ion_29","session_index":29,"source_sha256":"e5312fcc0dc5a8b507d70f55ad6c53e66d5ffe3e01208499fb7e767deb022252","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":18}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s2","store_snapshot_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","text":"Calvin: I'm stoked I made a difference. Paying it forward, ya know? Working with new talent brings new ideas to this. Look at this photo, here's how I'm making a beat for a young artist, he has great potential in music! \n[Image caption: a photo of a man sitting at a desk in front of a computer]\n[S29T13] (dia_id: D29:13)\n\nDave: Wow, that's cool! Your music studio looks great. Have you tried out any new ideas lately?\n[S29T14] (dia_id: D29:14)\n\nCalvin: Thanks! I'm having fun trying out new sounds and pushing the boundaries. It's great to go for new ideas and see where it takes me - always gotta stay ahead in this.\n[S29T15] (dia_id: D29:15)\n\nDave: Awesome, Calvin! Experimenting and pushing boundaries is key to making our art grow. Can't wait to see where these new ideas take you!\n[S29T16] (dia_id: D29:16)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, it's exciting to see where these new ideas lead. It's all about growing and evolving! Have a good one. I need to go now. Take care, Dave!\n[S29T17] (dia_id: D29:17)\n\nDave: For sure, Calvin! Growing and evolving is key for any artist. Don't stop pushing yourself and keep exploring. Can't wait to see what you come up with next! See ya Cal! Take care!\n[S29T18] (dia_id: D29:18)","text_sha256":"8e1ad5a7800fddc5fffd3f473ac57804ed41b7d6cafbe40d26e5fe465be607e5","timestamp":"2023-11-13T21:15:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D29:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":20,"line_start":18,"source_locators":["[S29T3]"],"text_sha256":"6b2f621ede120792ccc9ef2a7e6cdfc044a90247e7165b1bbbaf5c369f00fb36"},{"dia_ids":["D29:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":23,"line_start":22,"source_locators":["[